    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Overlay (midi-qol):</em> the Cube lingers: a creature it moves into, or that enters it or ends its turn there, takes the damage (once a turn). <strong>Teleport the Cube</strong> (a Magic action) moves it up to 30 feet to a point you place, without passing over anyone. It changes no item: midi applies it to any item with the identifier <code>cloud-of-daggers</code> (2024 rules) that nothing else automates.</p>",
